{
  "key": 9287,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm? You are here for my grandson?\n",
        "His name is Bill.\r",
        "He’s in Johto.\n",
        "He does something with PCs,\f",
        "so I’m house-sitting.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, my grandson mentioned a round,\n",
        "blue Pokémon that has leaves\f",
        "growing on its head.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Bill told me about a Pokémon that is\n",
        "very loyal to its Trainer.\f",
        "It’s a Fire-type Pokémon that’s\f",
        "supposed to Roar well.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know that Pokémon with large,\n",
        "round eyes.\r",
        "The one that sings a lullaby with\n",
        "its cute voice!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know that hugely popular\n",
        "Pokémon?\r",
        "The Pokémon that has a yellow body\n",
        "and bright red cheeks...\r",
        "I would love to see what it looks\n",
        "like before it evolves.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard that there is a blue and round\n",
        "Pokémon in Johto.\r",
        "Bill told me that the end of its tail\n",
        "works like a float.\r",
        "Its belly is white. Just the belly.\n",
        "I would love to see what it looks like.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "My grandson Bill told me about a\n",
        "Pokémon that has a long tongue.\r",
        "It has ringlike marks on the front\n",
        "of its legs, he said!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, my grandson mentioned a round,\n",
        "blue Pokémon that has leaves\f",
        "growing on its head.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know of a sea Pokémon that\n",
        "has a red sphere in its body?\f",
        "You know, the one that’s shaped like\f",
        "a star?\r",
        "I heard that it appears at night.\n",
        "I would surely like to see it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard about a cute Pokémon that\n",
        "has six tails.\r",
        "I would love to hug a cute Pokémon\n",
        "like that.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know that hugely popular\n",
        "Pokémon?\r",
        "The Pokémon that has a yellow body\n",
        "and bright red cheeks...\r",
        "I would love to see what it looks\n",
        "like before it evolves.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "If you have that Pokémon,\n",
        "may I see it, please? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "You will show me?\n",
        "How good of you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t have it?\n",
        "That’s too bad..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm?\r",
        "That’s not the Pokémon that I was\n",
        "told about..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow!\n",
        "That Pokémon is called {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It’s a wonderful Pokémon!\n",
        "As a token of my appreciation,\f",
        "I would like to give this to you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Come visit again\n",
        "sometime."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks for showing me so many\n",
        "cute Pokémon.\f",
        "I really enjoyed myself.\r",
        "I’m glad I’ve lived such a long life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0364_R25R0101_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a dusty machine under\n",
        "the cloth cover...\f",
        "It has not been used for some time."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
